# Layout n4x-1017-35 (2026-10-18; engine 309ef6d1 and indexer in INT8 since 2026-10-20): N4X's cards and draft head with
# DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017-EXL3-3.5bpw, split by layers. Switch: ln -sfn layouts/n4x-1017-35.env ~/serve/ds41-exl3.env && sudo systemctl restart ds41-exl3
# EXL3_DSA_INDEXER_DTYPE as in tp5-1017-35.env. The FP16 indexer on the earlier engine 16d01882: layouts/n4x-1017-35-fp16.env
CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0,1,3,2
TABBY_EXL3_GENERATOR_CHUNK=16384
EXLLAMAV3_TUNE_CACHE=/home/ai/serve/autotune-1017
EXL3_DSA_INDEXER_DTYPE=sm_80:int8,sm_120:int8
PYTHONPATH=/home/ai/rnd/release/all/src-309ef6d11920:/home/ai/rnd/release/all/native-309ef6d11920:/home/ai/rnd/tabby-fresh
DS41_CONFIG=/home/ai/serve/ds41-exl3-n4x-1017-35.yml
EXLLAMA_NO_P2P_COPY=1
# All four cards at x16 since 2026-10-18: the third 170HX takes 58 GB and every expert fits on a card. Measured
# warm (2026-10-18, engine 16d01882, FP16 indexer): prefill 1,765 / 1,856 tok/s on 34K prompts, decode 42-56 tok/s drafted. The tail 64 experts
# of layers 10-39 on the CPU gave 495 tok/s and 4-6 tok/s, with the pinned arena (-mcpa) 503 and 4-6: not used.
